OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition tells story of queen of
OL,4,Acrime fiction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exhibition examining the work of
OL,7,Fcrime novelist Agatha Christie is to
OL,8,Ftour Surrey libraries.
OL,10,FAgatha Christie: World of Mystery opens
OL,11,Fin Redhill on Monday, and will move to
OL,12,FStaines on 15 December and Guildford on
OL,13,F10 February 2027.
OL,15,FDuring the author's mysterious 11-day
OL,16,Fdisappearance in 1926, her abandoned
OL,17,Fcar was found at Newlands Corner in the
OL,18,FSurrey Hills, while a search was
OL,19,Fcarried out at the Silent Pool, a lake
OL,20,Fnear Guildford, after a hoax message.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
